{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8LNETYFeWSXMQVNSKLR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't get any of this from the California Secretary of State, so I have nothing to report for the five entities. I haven't filled the gaps with third-party data, since you asked for official SOS data only.\n\nThe SOS business search (bizfile Online) rejected my automated request. It returned a bot-protection challenge page instead of results. I didn't try to get around that block. The scraping tools I have would be a workaround for it, and the SOS has its own sanctioned routes.\n\nWays to get the data:\n\n1. **Manual search, about 5 minutes.** Go to https://bizfileonline.sos.ca.gov/search/business and search each name. The entity detail page shows everything you asked for: entity number, status, initial filing date, state of formation (jurisdiction), and agent for service of process.\n2. **Certificate of status.** If this is for contract diligence, you can order one from the SOS for each entity (bizfile Online, or by mail). It is the formal proof that an entity is in good standing. The search page is fine for a quick check.\n3. **SOS bulk data or API.** The SOS offers a paid Business Entities API and bulk data files. I can wire one up if you have a key.\n\nSeveral of these companies are Delaware corporations registered in California as foreign corporations. For those, the CA record will show the Delaware formation and a CA registration date, not a CA incorporation date. Anthropic PBC is a Delaware public benefit corporation. Entity names on the SOS may differ slightly from what you listed, for example \"Notion Labs, Inc.\" with a comma. Search on a distinctive part of each name, such as \"Rippling\".\n\nIf you paste in the detail pages or the search results, I can check them against your five names and flag any suspended, forfeited or missing entities. Don't rely on my memory of these entities for signing decisions."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":572,"cache_read_input_tokens":19337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":572},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35318abb-9d77-4b61-8532-82e4fbe70f76","uuid":"194c13b8-4e49-4add-917b-5361f8e0a0c2","timestamp":"2026-10-17T19:08:07.744Z","request_id":"req_011Cg8LNEBgBsjrQMQgTjHF6"}
